; Circular step-response tuning move around G54 origin.
; 1cm radius (10mm) circle repeated in the XY plane at Z0.
; Load in MDI/program after homing. Verify G54 / tool / spindle safety before running.

G21 G90 G17 G40 G49 G80

#1 = 1
#<iterations> = 100
#<RADIUS> = 5

G0 Z5
G0 X10 Y0
G4 P0.5
M1
G1 Z0 F1000
G4 P0.5
M1
O100 WHILE [#1 LE #<iterations>]
G3 X10 Y0 I[-#<radius>] J0 F3000
M1
#1 =[ #1 + 1]
O100 ENDWHILE
G1 Z5 F1000

G0 X0 Y0

M2
